# Machine-local plugin entries, copied here by install.sh on first run.
#
# Same format as plugins.conf, one repository per line; this file is
# git-ignored, so a machine-specific checkout or a plugin repository you would
# rather not name in the tracked manifest goes here.
#
#   URL              clone the default branch
#   URL REF          check out REF (a tag or branch) instead
#   /path/to/repo    a checkout on this machine, instead of a remote
#
# A checkout already present in plugins/ is used as it is; listing it here only
# keeps it in the manifest, which is what makes Settings -> Updates report and
# update it.
#
# Examples:
#   https://github.com/Fruffel/dsh-llm-llamacpp.git
#   https://github.com/Fruffel/dsh-llm-llamacpp.git v1.2.0
#   /home/you/Documents/projects/dsh-llm-llamacpp
